\description{
Colour and fill scales built from a combination. The \verb{_d} scales are
discrete (one colour per level), \verb{_c} continuous and \verb{_b} binned.
\verb{scale_*_haishoku()} is discrete by default; set \code{discrete = FALSE} for a
